## Article 6. Language of appeals and decisions and responses thereto

```catala
declaration scope Article6Language:
  input state_language content YesNo
  input english_language content YesNo
  output language_compliant content YesNo

scope Article6Language:
  label lang_compliant
  definition language_compliant equals No

  label state_lang_exception exception lang_compliant
  definition language_compliant under condition
    state_language = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label english_lang_exception exception lang_compliant
  definition language_compliant under condition
    english_language = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
